{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"弥迦书","commonName":"弥迦书","title":"弥迦书","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"5d5b897647548ba0f6a03c05fd8c35d9e107b33b299c49301880b3a83eca015c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华谴责以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列人哪，当听耶和华的话！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要起来向山岭争辩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使冈陵听你的话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"山岭和地永久的根基啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听耶和华争辩的话！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华要与他的百姓争辩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与以色列争论。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"我的百姓啊，我向你做了什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在什么事上使你厌烦？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你可以对我证明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾将你从埃及地领出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从作奴仆之家救赎你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也差遣摩西、亚伦，和米利暗在你前面行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓啊，你们当追念摩押王巴勒所设的谋","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和比珥的儿子巴兰回答他的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并你们从什亭到吉甲所遇见的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好使你们知道耶和华公义的作为。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的要求"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我朝见耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在至高 神面前跪拜，当献上什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂可献一岁的牛犊为燔祭吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华岂喜悦千千的公羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或是万万的油河吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我岂可为自己的罪过献我的长子吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为心中的罪恶献我身所生的吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人哪，耶和华已指示你何为善。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他向你所要的是什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只要你行公义，好怜悯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"存谦卑的心，与你的 神同行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和华向这城呼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧人必敬畏他的名。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们当听是谁派定刑杖的惩罚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶人家中不仍有非义之财","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和可恶的小升斗吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我若用不公道的天平和囊中诡诈的法码，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂可算为清洁呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城里的富户满行强暴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的居民也说谎言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"口中的舌头是诡诈的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我击打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的伤痕甚重，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你因你的罪恶荒凉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要吃，却吃不饱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的虚弱必显在你中间。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必挪去，却不得救护；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所救护的，我必交给刀剑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必撒种，却不得收割；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踹橄榄，却不得油抹身；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踹葡萄，却不得酒喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你守暗利的恶规，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行亚哈家一切所行的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"顺从他们的计谋；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我必使你荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的居民令人嗤笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们也必担当我民的羞辱。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MIC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}